So try out these tactics.

00:20:17.014 --> 00:20:19.441
It doesn't matter if you're e-commerce,

00:20:19.441 --> 00:20:22.694
lead gen, a service-based business.

00:20:22.694 --> 00:20:24.713
You can always test out these tactics.

00:20:24.713 --> 00:20:27.162
I've done it on all these
types of sites and it works.

00:20:27.162 --> 00:20:28.800
I guarantee you actually will see

00:20:28.800 --> 00:20:30.156
more growth from your business.

00:20:30.156 --> 00:20:31.476
If you don't, you can email me,

00:20:31.476 --> 00:20:34.441
heckle me, and I'll actually
give you free advice.

00:20:34.441 --> 00:20:35.884
Take care, thanks.

